OL,3,GNEWSATfL fined #2m after woman, 74,
OL,4,Akilled in bus crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport for London (TfL) has been
OL,7,Fconvicted and fined #2m after a
OL,8,F74-year-old woman was hit by a bus and
OL,9,Fkilled while using a pedestrian
OL,10,Fcrossing at Walthamstow bus station.
OL,12,FGrace Mecaley was walking home on 15
OL,13,FDecember 2023 when she was struck by a
OL,14,Fdouble-decker bus as she was about
OL,15,Ftwo-thirds of the way across the road.
OL,16,FThe retired nurse suffered fatal
OL,17,Finjuries and was pronounced dead at the
OL,18,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
