OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATfL fined #2m after woman, 74,
OL,4,Akilled in bus crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation by the Health and
OL,7,FSafety Executive (HSE) found that TfL
OL,8,Fhad failed to ensure pedestrians and
OL,9,Fvehicles could circulate safely at the
OL,10,Fbus station.
OL,12,FHSE Inspector Laurence Goodacre said
OL,13,FMecaley was a "vibrant member of her
OL,14,Fcommunity" whose death was "deeply
OL,15,Ffelt".
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
